  "changes": [
    "Stage native compact and DWARF LSDA/personality metadata, ordinary local/imported data pointers, RTTI GOT slots and authenticated personality slots in modern and threaded arm64e images.",
    "Retain CIE/FDE language pointer offsets and encodings; resolve assembler-local differences before logical decoding, then relocate against final storage addresses.",
    "Reuse or allocate IA/address-diversified personality slots, retaining exact provider and ordinary versus authenticated pointer identity through independent reload.",
    "Place compact/DWARF metadata in proven unowned TEXT gaps; size EH storage to actual bytes and preserve existing signed CFI states.",
    "Recognize object-local private weak code helpers, including the optimized auto-hide flag combination; refuse exported weak definitions.",
    "Resolve language names from canonical ordinary bindings and authenticated recipes without inventing ordinary import-storage evidence for signed slots."
  ],
